### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "PedestrianCrossingInHeavyRain" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian walking across street in heavy rain" .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy rain with reduced visibility" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Orange traffic cones on road" .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrian crossing path of vehicle in heavy rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to heavy rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .
```

